    "descriptionHtml": "<p>A small crescent shape, a curved zip opening and a softly pebbled surface give Alba its quiet character. The short handle keeps the silhouette compact, while the longer strap offers another way to carry it. Silver-tone hardware adds a restrained finishing detail.</p><p>Inside, a zippered pocket and card compartment help separate smaller belongings. At 15 × 10 × 14 cm, Alba is a compact choice for a light everyday carry.</p>",
